exports[`follow-up templates (done-for-you: one action, one no-login link) > live templates (golden): what works, the number, the page, a login link 1`] = `
"Hi Jane,

🎉 You're live! Here's what's working now:
  • Calls you miss are forwarded to your text-back number at (705) 555-0000. The caller gets a text from you in seconds.
  • Every new lead lands in your inbox, and the follow-ups and reminders are switched on.
  • Your new page is live: https://app.crankleads.test/s/janes-roofing

Log in any time: https://app.crankleads.test

Questions? Just reply to this email.

— The CrankLeads team"
`;

exports[`follow-up templates (done-for-you: one action, one no-login link) > reminder email (golden) — never asks for Stripe, prices or wizard steps 1`] = `
"Hi Jane,

Quick nudge: Jane's Roofing is one step from live: turn on call forwarding on your business phone so every call you miss gets a text back. It's one tap.

Turn on forwarding: https://app.crankleads.test/forward/AbCdEfGhIjKlMnOpQrStUvWxYz012345

