Questions? Just reply to this email.

— The CrankLeads team

Don't want these setup reminders? Stop them: https://app.crankleads.test/api/public/crankleads/setup-reminders?token=aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa"
`;

